  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅標題\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 橫幅\"></a> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Overview.webp\" alt=\"概覽橫幅\"></p><hr><p><strong>Amazing Xray</strong> 是一個基於 Minecraft 的透視材質包整合包。相容於所有原版伺服器，並完整優化，內含光影效果。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"網站\"></a></p><hr><h3>[✔️] G - 透視設定</h3><h3>[✔️] # - 啟用/停用透視</h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord 橫幅\"></a></p><h3>整合包注意事項</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是遊玩此整合包的 YouTuber 或內容創作者，請在說明中放置連結回連至此頁面，以便他人知曉您所使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 CurseForge 上重新上傳此整合包或任何修改版本，也不得轉發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我本人的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
